    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1243">

                <pb facs="1063" n="959" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg959"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 711.1215/392.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Mexican Ambassador to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Translation.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Mexican Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1911-12-15">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 15, 1911</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>In compliance with urgent telegraphic instructions from my Government I beg your
                    excellency to be pleased to interpose good offices to prevent Marshal Hillebrand
                    from forcibly ejecting various occupants Chamizal zone, some of them holding
                    Mexican titles, which would be an injury to Mexicans and a violation of the
                    status quo. Department of [Foreign Relations of] Mexico was informed.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Crespo</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
